From e8b5c5daffc4e4a5910dd99b72d06c6882ac1766 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Lane A <lane-a@local.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:30:26 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] refactor(recommendations): use the amendment's layout
 names and the app's caption presets

framing.layout: stacked_reactor | pip_preserved | full (was facecam_split |
game_with_facecam_inset | game_only). Zoom target: facecam | gameplay (was
center). caption_plan.position now carries the app's own preset names
(clip_edits.CAPTION_POSITIONS) plus anchor=pane_seam for the stacked
two-pane layout, matching Sanji's merged composition. No consumer had
integrated the old names. Advisory data only; covered by the existing
CHANGELOG entry for reaction editing suggestions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
